Package: omopRToolkit
Title: Bundling of OMOP tools for eyes-off analysis
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: 
    person("James", "Mitchell-White", , "james.mitchell-white1@nottingham.ac.uk", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Darwin-EU have provided R tools for interacting with OMOP-CDM databases.
    Here, we provide some of these tools in a single container with some scripts to run these analyses with remote job execution.
